t with your truck you're  taking a big gamble with your  transmission and your chassis and all  that stuff man  brute force yoinking out a stump is hard  to do fyi sticking your chainsaw in the  dirt like that destroys your chainsaw  blades that one was on its way out  anyway so i kind of did it but you might  want to use an axe instead  now i know a lot of you guys are  wondering luke why don't you just blow  up those stumps  and you can there's a product called  tanonite which is a target practicing  explosive and you can buy it from  cabela's in other places and have it  delivered to your door and it's a  two-part explosive that you mix together  you dig a hole under the stump you put  about  five pounds of it underneath there and  boom you blow that thing up  now there's a couple problems first off  it's a bit of a legal gray area i'm in  my state it's a serious felony to have  bomb making equipment and bomb making  materials and  it's a little bit of a gray area whether  or not tananite classifies as bomb  making materials and i'm a criminal  defense attorney by trade and i  researched the issue and i'm telling you  it's unclear so i'm not going to mess  with it it takes a lot of explosives and  a lot of digging to blow up a stop  because you got to put the explosives  underneath the stump and then it wants  to just blow the dirt out around the  stump without blowing up the stump so  you've gotta you put like five pounds  plus of explosives and five pounds of  tan a night will probably run you like  eighty to a hundred dollars so you know  it's not cheap it's might get you in  jail so before you try blowing anything  up definitely think twice and check your  local loss well all the techniques i've  been showing you so far are great if you  only have one or two stumps to remove  but if you're like me and have 50 to 100  stumps to remove  you're gonna want this  [Music]  if you want to remove stumps quickly and  have fun doing it it's hard to beat a  backhoe even